{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant pixel-art world where strategy and creativity collide! In this city-building deck-building game, every card is a piece of your puzzle. Place buildings on a dynamic hexagonal grid, optimize your resource generation, and manage prices to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexagonal City-Building:</strong> Place cards strategically to create a thriving city, balancing resources like Wheat, Meat, Metal, and Products. <strong>And u</strong>pgrade your city with houses, shops, and factories to boost resource production and create powerful combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.poster.avif?t=1759701549\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.webm?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/0258bc6160d37949c12e379c5620bfae.mp4?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Progression:</strong> Buy cards from a shop or select random rewards after each level to customize your deck and refine your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/06b35f19d3f6070f8be775448f2b29fc.poster.avif?t=1759701549\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/06b35f19d3f6070f8be775448f2b29fc.webm?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/06b35f19d3f6070f8be775448f2b29fc.mp4?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Relics for Global Upgrades:</strong> Unlock powerful global upgrades that enhance your abilities and provide game-changing effects.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/5e1d88b90c1b789ade0283ca274cd3ea.poster.avif?t=1759701549\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/5e1d88b90c1b789ade0283ca274cd3ea.webm?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/extras/5e1d88b90c1b789ade0283ca274cd3ea.mp4?t=1759701549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between resource generation, economic growth, and powerful upgrades to expand your city and unlock new challenges. Will you build the ultimate city?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424190?t=1759701549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424190?t=1759701549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/300416f4e04f0f795e4e72c8d5b7a1ea1f9fa4a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759701549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424190/300416f4e04f0f795e4e72c8d5b7a1ea1f9fa4a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759701549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3492900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant pix